        "questions_answered": [
          "Q: Is WHERE clause the same as guard? A: No, different features - WHERE filters input (before), guard validates output (after)",
          "Q: Do guards work with batch? A: Yes, perfectly! Same behavior in batch and non-batch mode",
          "Q: Why do files always exist with Anthropic? A: All providers persist files for audit trail, it's intentional design"
