      "scope": "system-wide fix affecting all batch providers"
    },
    {
      "bug_id": 6,
      "title": "VendorAPIError incorrect signature across multiple providers",
      "description": "VendorAPIError calls were passing message as first parameter instead of vendor/endpoint",
      "files": [
        "agent_actions/integrations/providers/base.py (1 occurrence)",
        "agent_actions/integrations/providers/openai/provider.py (4 occurrences)",
        "agent_actions/integrations/providers/gemini/provider.py (5 occurrences)"
      ],
      "error": "TypeError: VendorAPIError.__init__() missing 1 required positional argument: 'endpoint'",
      "fix": "Updated all VendorAPIError calls to use signature: VendorAPIError(vendor=..., endpoint=..., context={message: ...})",
      "severity": "high",
      "impact": "Fixed error handling across OpenAI, Gemini, and base provider",
      "discovered_during": "unit_testing",
      "scope": "system-wide fix affecting multiple batch providers"
    },
    {
      "bug_id": 7,
      "title": "Gemini schema added before request dict was defined",
      "description": "In format_task_for_provider, schema was being added to request dict before request was created",
      "file": "agent_actions/integrations/providers/gemini/provider.py",
      "lines": "87-102",
      "error": "NameError: name 'request' is not defined",
      "fix": "Moved schema addition (lines 99-102) after request dict creation (lines 87-97)",
      "severity": "critical",
      "impact": "Fixed Gemini provider's format_task_for_provider method when using schemas",
      "discovered_during": "unit_testing"
    }
  ],

  "implementation_notes": {
    "total_bugs_fixed": 7,
    "critical_bugs": 2,
    "high_severity_bugs": 3,
    "medium_severity_bugs": 2,
    "system_wide_fixes": 3,
    "key_learnings": [
      "Always use Python None instead of JavaScript null in Python dicts",
      "Don't add fields with None values to JSONL - omit them entirely",
      "json_mode: false should work without schemas for all batch providers",
      "output_field behavior must match between online and batch modes",
      "Test with both json_mode: true and json_mode: false scenarios",
      "VendorAPIError requires vendor and endpoint as first two parameters",
      "Base test classes enable contract testing across all provider implementations",
      "Provider-specific tests can override base tests when formats differ (e.g., Gemini's 'key' vs 'custom_id')"
    ],
    "testing_insights": [
      "Integration testing revealed 5 bugs that unit tests would have missed",
      "Unit testing revealed 2 additional bugs in error handling and Gemini provider",
      "The 'null' syntax error only manifests at runtime, not during code review",
      "Schema validation bug affected all providers, not just Ollama",
      "output_field feature gap existed in batch mode since initial implementation",
      "VendorAPIError signature bug existed in 10 locations across 3 files",
      "Test architecture combining fixtures + base class + provider tests scales well"
    ]
  },

